## 📂 PROJECT STRUCTURE

**Monorepo:** Nuzantara uses pnpm workspaces

```
nuzantara/
├── apps/
│   ├── backend-rag/     # Python 3.11 + FastAPI (Primary)
│   ├── mouth/           # Next.js 16 + React 19 (Frontend)
│   └── bali-intel-scraper/  # News pipeline
├── docs/                # ⭐ Read first!
├── scripts/             # Deployment, testing, utilities
└── .cursorrules         # ← This file
```

---

## 🎯 WORKFLOW STANDARD AI AGENT

### 1. Context Acquisition
```bash
# Leggi documentazione obbligatoria
- docs/AI_ONBOARDING.md
- docs/SYSTEM_MAP_4D.md
- docs/AI_AGENT_BEST_PRACTICES.md
```

### 2. Implementation
```python
# Implementa con type hints, logging, error handling
import logging
logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)

async def new_feature(data: dict) -> Result:
    logger.info("Starting new_feature")
    try:
        result = await process(data)
        logger.info(f"✅ Success: {result}")
        return result
    except Exception as e:
        logger.error(f"❌ Failed: {e}", exc_info=True)
        raise
```

### 3. Testing
```bash
# Auto-format
cd apps/backend-rag
ruff format backend/
ruff check backend/

# Test
PYTHONPATH=backend pytest tests/unit/ -q --tb=short

# Coverage (if new feature)
PYTHONPATH=backend pytest --cov=backend.services.new_feature \
  --cov-report=html --cov-fail-under=90
```

### 4. Deploy
```bash
# Commit
git add .
git commit -m "feat: implement feature X with tests"

# Deploy (MANDATORY: use safe-deploy.sh)
./scripts/safe-deploy.sh
```

### 5. Monitoring
```bash
# Check logs post-deploy
flyctl logs -a nuzantara-rag

# Check health
curl https://nuzantara-rag.fly.dev/health
```

